Line	What it does
103–104	Tmp_Txn: loads all clean transactions into a temporary table.
106–107	Tmp_Risk: loads all clean risk flags into a second temporary table.
110 Map_RiskCount:	Names a mapping table.
111 Mapping LOAD transaction_id, Count(risk_flag_id)	A mapping load has exactly two columns, a key and a value. Here: transaction and its number of flags.
