124 FactTransactions:	Names the main table.
126 *	Brings in every column from Tmp_Txn.
127 transaction_id as %txn_key	A copy of the id under a hidden-style name. Fields starting with % are keys that Qlik Sense normally hides from the field list.
128 ApplyMap('Map_RiskCount', transaction_id, 0) as risk_flag_count	Looks up this transaction in the map. If it isn’t found, the third argument, 0, is used.
129	Same for the High-severity count.
